    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself trapped in an abandoned school classroom, where space is warped, and anomalies lurk in the most unexpected places. Find them to escape \u2014 but beware: every choice leads to unpredictable consequences. Psychological tension, hidden threats, and a growing sense of dread will haunt you until the very end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attention and Memory Challenge: Memorize the room\u2019s details to spot changes and uncover anomalies later.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomaly Hunting</strong>: From subtle shifts to blatant distortions of reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eerie Atmosphere</strong>: An abandoned classroom, chilling sounds, and a constant feeling of being watched.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Traps</strong>: Every action triggers events that can alter the game\u2019s course.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Through Notes</strong>: Uncover what happened in the classroom and why you\u2019re here.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Exit, Many Paths</strong>: But not every path leads to freedom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is simple \u2014 observe, remember, decide. But know this: this classroom hides more than meets the eye.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play Anomaly Rooms</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the classroom and look around, carefully memorizing everything in it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the green and red piece and insert it into the &quot;Exit&quot; sign.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there are no anomalies \u2014 insert the green piece. If you notice an anomaly (new objects, disappearances, sounds\u2026) \u2014 insert the red piece.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classroom will try to confuse and kill you. Try to survive!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the lock code \u2014 it appears after inserting the piece into the sign. Enter the code into the lock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t take items to the corridor. Toys, lamps, chairs, desks must stay in the classroom. Otherwise, the exit won\u2019t open.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the green &quot;Exit&quot; sign and escape the time loop. If you\u2019re doing everything right, the green pieces will stay in the sign. The classroom will try to destroy you. Find the exit. Don\u2019t let it fool you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself trapped in an abandoned school classroom, where space is warped, and anomalies lurk in the most unexpected places. Find them to escape \u2014 but beware: every choice leads to unpredictable consequences. Psychological tension, hidden threats, and a growing sense of dread will haunt you until the very end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attention and Memory Challenge: Memorize the room\u2019s details to spot changes and uncover anomalies later.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomaly Hunting</strong>: From subtle shifts to blatant distortions of reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eerie Atmosphere</strong>: An abandoned classroom, chilling sounds, and a constant feeling of being watched.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Traps</strong>: Every action triggers events that can alter the game\u2019s course.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Through Notes</strong>: Uncover what happened in the classroom and why you\u2019re here.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Exit, Many Paths</strong>: But not every path leads to freedom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is simple \u2014 observe, remember, decide. But know this: this classroom hides more than meets the eye.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play Anomaly Rooms</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the classroom and look around, carefully memorizing everything in it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the green and red piece and insert it into the &quot;Exit&quot; sign.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there are no anomalies \u2014 insert the green piece. If you notice an anomaly (new objects, disappearances, sounds\u2026) \u2014 insert the red piece.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classroom will try to confuse and kill you. Try to survive!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the lock code \u2014 it appears after inserting the piece into the sign. Enter the code into the lock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t take items to the corridor. Toys, lamps, chairs, desks must stay in the classroom. Otherwise, the exit won\u2019t open.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the green &quot;Exit&quot; sign and escape the time loop. If you\u2019re doing everything right, the green pieces will stay in the sign. The classroom will try to destroy you. Find the exit. Don\u2019t let it fool you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
